    <string name="instructions1">1. ABOUT THE APPLICATION</string>
    <string name="instructions1_content">This app "ACTION DRIVING SCHOOL" teaches traffic rules and contains official provisional exam questions.</string>
    <string name="instructions2">2. HOW THE APPLICATION WORKS</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_1">1. To use this app, you must first register by entering your name and phone number.</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_2">2. If you already registered, you do not register again; just enter your phone number and click “Verify” to access the dashboard.</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_3">3. To begin studying, click "Tests". There are 21 tests, each with 20 questions; the first test is free, others require payment.</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_4">4.  When you are practicing in this application, if you tap the correct answer, it turns green. If you tap the wrong one, it turns red because you are practicing. Then you immediately see the correct answer. After that, you press “Next” to go to another question.
When you reach the last one, you press “Finish Exam,” and you will immediately see the score you got. Then you press “Home” to choose another exam to study.</string>

    <string name="instructions3">3. HOW THE REAL MACHINE TEST LOOKS</string>
    <string name="instructions_3_conten_1">When you take the official provisional exam, the questions will be the same as those in the app. Select answers using (✔️) then press *Next*. After finishing, click “Finish Test” to see your score, just like this app.</string>

    <string name="instructions4">4. PAYMENT TO UNLOCK ALL TESTS</string>
    <string name="instructions4_content_1">1. As mentioned above, only the first test is free. The remaining 20 cost 5000 RWF paid to 0782877442 or MoMoPay: 847318 (Alexis).</string>
    <string name="instructions4_content_2">2. After paying, go back and wait 5 minutes. When you return, tests will be unlocked (the red lock will turn green). Make sure you have internet.</string>
    <string name="instructions_4_content_3">3.  5000 RWF unlocks all tests fo 3 months.</string>


